└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

After solution found, UNWIND & BACKTRACK:
  row=4 returns → row=3 removes Q at col=2, tries col=3 → blocked
  row=3 returns → row=2 removes Q at col=0, tries col=1,2,3 → blocked
  row=2 returns → row=1 removes Q at col=3, tries col=4 → done
  row=1 returns → row=0 removes Q at col=1, tries col=2 → new branch...
```

